# --- data ---
# Raw cricsheet ball-by-ball match archive: the DATA PIPELINE'S INPUT, not
# something the live game or the shipped model reads. 2.1 GB extracted /
# 122 MB zipped -- both far too large for git, and neither is needed to
# clone this repo and run the app. The pipeline's OUTPUTS the app actually
# reads (backend/data_pipeline/*.json, data/*.csv) are committed normally.
data/all_male.zip
data/all_male/
